  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The dual circle icon being used in unconnected ways is constantly confusing people. \n\nIt is used to indicate two separate things:\n1. Which platform is certain content available for, such as worlds and avatars\n2. What platform is a user currently on\n\nThese should be distinct indicators. Certainly showing a user with the PC icon and Quest circle grey suggests that they might be able to be both at once? \n\nIt has come up multiple times when people don’t understand that it does not mean that the player’s avatar is visible to that platform.",
